<title>SWITZERLAND: Helvetia Patria boosts 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Helvetia Patria boosts 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>ST GALLEN, Switzerland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>			    (millions of Swiss francs unless noted)</p>
<p> Consolidated premium income		3,740     vs   3,500</p>
<p> Consolidated profit			     56.2   vs	41.6</p>
<p> Dividend (Swiss francs)			 18     vs	14</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Helvetia Patria Holding, whose shares have been listed since July 5, 1996. The dividend comparison is with that of Helvetia shares. Despite weakness in premium growth partly as a result of economic conditions, profit grew thanks to a favourable claims record, an &quot;excellent&quot; financial result and declining costs, it said. -- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631</p>
</text>
